                <description>Active high soft reset of the AXON IP. Does not reset configuration registers. Reset is performed asynchronously. Deassertion of reset is synchronoush and only takes a few cycles to propagate through synchrnonizers. Should be used to recover from any error interrupt by performing soft reset, then clearing all interrupts then retrying all descriptor batch.</description>
