                <description>DC offset cancellation value for the Q channel. 2's complement value, where the number of integer bits are defined by the Q channel size and the remainder bits are fractional. The fractional bits enter a wrapping accumulator and the carry from this is summed with the integer offset.</description>
                <lsb>12</lsb>
