            <resetValue>0x00000000</resetValue>
            <size>0x20</size>
            <fields>
              <field>
                <name>FINALPERIODADJUSTA</name>
                <description>The value written to this field defines the duration of the last symbol of the current frame only. At the end of the current frame this field is automatically set to equal the value of FINALPERIODA.</description>
                <lsb>8</lsb>
                <msb>23</msb>
              </field>
            </fields>
          </register>
          <register>
            <name>APPLYPARAMETERSA</name>
            <description>SCP APPLY PARAMETERS A</description>
            <addressOffset>0x1B8</addressOffset>
            <access>read-write</access>
            <resetValue>0x00000000</resetValue>
            <size>0x20</size>
            <fields>
              <field>
                <name>APPLYPARAMETERSA</name>
                <description>If the SYNCHRONISEUPDATES bit is set in the Control register, a number of parameters are updated synchronously when the sample number is equal to (APPLYPARAMETERSA - 1). Thus, with the control bit set, writes to the parameter fields are held off until SAMPLENUMBERA = (APPLYPARAMETERSA - 1). If SYNCHRONISEUPDATES is not set, updates to the parameters occur immediately that they are written to the appropriate registers.
          The following parameter updates are synchronized:
          - GAINCONTROL1
          - GAINCONTROL2
          - OFFSETCONTROL1
          - OFFSETCONTROL2
          - DCOFFSETI
          - DCOFFSETQ
          - COARSEGAIN
          - IGAIN
          - QGAIN
          - ITOQGAIN
          - FS
          - FC</description>
                <lsb>8</lsb>
                <msb>23</msb>
              </field>
            </fields>
          </register>
