                <description>Defines the centre frequency of the first notch of the ACI / CCI filter.
          FREQ is a signed (2's complement) number, where the full-scale negative value represents a frequency of - RCLK/2 (where RCLK is the output sample rate).</description>
                <lsb>8</lsb>
