          0: TXFD Input
          1: TXFD Output
          2: RXTD Input
          3: RXTD OFDM Output
          4: RXTD DSSS Output
          5: FFT Input
          6: FFT Output
          7: TXTD Input
          8: TXTD Output
          9: RXFD FFT Input
          10: RXFD Output</description>
                <lsb>0</lsb>
                <msb>10</msb>
