                <name>WLANTXPINTERLEAVER4NROWS</name>
                <description>This field specifies the number of active rows in the TXP Bit Interleaver.  Note that each 'row' element holds Nbpsc bits of data.
          Valid values are shown below; other values are reserved and should not be used.
          Legacy: 3
          HT20:   4
          HT40:   6
          VHT80:  9
          HE:     1, 3, 6, 9, 12
          Relevant when WLANTXPTXMODE is 0.</description>
                <lsb>0</lsb>
                <msb>3</msb>
              </field>
              <field>
                <name>WLANTXPINTERLEAVER4NCOLS</name>
                <description>This field specifies the number of active columns in the TXP Bit Interleaver (i.e. row width).  Valid values are shown below; other values are reserved and should not be used.
          Legacy: 16
          HT20:   13
          HT40:   18
          VHT80:  26
          HE:     4, 8, 13, 16, 17, 24, 26, 39
          Note that the maximum number of columns is 18 when WLANTXPWIFIACSUPPORT = 0.
          Relevant when WLANTXPTXMODE is 0.</description>
