              <field>
                <name>SAMPLEIEXT</name>
                <description>When TXSCPDEBUG=0: In phase output sample. Valid when SAMPLEVALID = 1. To acknowledge sample has been read, write any value to TXSCPSAMPLE register.
          
          When TXSCPDEBUG=1: Live state of the valid flow control signals
          0: TX-SCP WR
          1: Pre-Interpolalation CFR Input
          2: Pre-Interpolalation CFR Output
          3: Interpolalation Filter Output
          4: Post-Interpolalation CFR Output
          5: Resampler CFR Output
          6: Mixer Output
          7: DPD Output
          8: Gain Angle Output
          9: IQ Imbalance Output
          10: Phase Compensation Filter Output
          11: DC Offset Output
          12: Synchroniser Input
          13: Synchroniser Output Pre-Holdoff
          14: Synchroniser Output Post-Holdoff
          15: Pre-interpolation IQ Imbalance</description>
                <lsb>0</lsb>
                <msb>15</msb>
              </field>
            </fields>
          </register>
