          Delay required to account for propogation of cleared source event through cascaded gate delay
          within EFS, to allow the interrupt enable to be toggled to generate an ECU edge-sensitive interrupt
          for additional events whilst preventing surplus interrupt generation.</description>
                <lsb>0</lsb>
                <msb>8</msb>
              </field>
            </fields>
