              <name>VAL</name>
              <description>Output voltage in PWM_UPSCALE2 state is determined by equation 1.1V + TRIM.VOUTPWM + UPSCALE2OFFSET. For example TRIM.VOUTPWM can contain -96mV offset and UPSCALE2OFFSET +96mV. This would results 1.04V in PWM state and 1.1V in PWM_UPSCALE2 state.</description>
              <lsb>0</lsb>
              <msb>5</msb>
            </field>
          </fields>
